This ontology fragment represents the classes `WCKey`, `WCKeyResponse`, and `WCKeyRemovedResponse`, as well as the object properties `hasId`, `getWCKey`, and `deleteWCKey`. The `hasId` property is used to describe the ID of a `WCKey`, while `getWCKey` and `deleteWCKey` are used to describe the operations of getting and deleting a `WCKey`, respectively. The range of these properties is `xsd:string`. The class `wckeys` represents a collection of `WCKey` objects.
